# Lurrus of the Dream-Den: "Companion - Each permanent card in your starting deck has mana value 2 or less." Bot1 chose Lurrus
# as its companion when it built its deck, and the deck's permanents are Swamps, Moxen and an Ornithopter, so Lurrus is
# revealed before the game with nothing asked (CR 103.2b); another Lurrus is a plain sideboard card. Once during the game, any
# time it has priority during its own main phase with the stack empty, Bot1 may pay {3} and put the companion into its hand
# (CR 702.139a, 116.2g): not with one mana, not in its end step, not in Bot2's main phase, not with Ornithopter on the stack.
# Taken, it is in the game, and the other Lurrus, never revealed, can't be taken.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Lurrus of the Dream-Den

[Bot1 Companion]
Lurrus of the Dream-Den

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x27

[Actions]
? Bot1.Companion = Lurrus of the Dream-Den
? Bot1.Revealed = Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
! Bot1.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.End]
! Bot1.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
! Bot1.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
! Bot1.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion

[Expect]
Bot1.Companion = Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Bot1.Sideboard = Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Bot1.Hand = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Bot1.Battlefield = Ornithopter; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = false
